<p>Howdy!</p>
<p>First off, thank you for the positive response, I appreciate it! As this is my first SCP I have written, I did not at all want to do one of the &quot;no-no's&quot; listed and mention another SCP to gain recognition for this SCP / all that jazz. If there's enough support I would be more than willing to contact the original/current author of SCP-187 and talk to her/him about their opinion on the subject and see if we can't collaborate something.</p>
<p>I really appreciate the support. If I feel like I can continue to get support for this SCP, I would totally be down for writing more. The only issue is that it <em>is</em> such a time commitment, and I probably edited this over 20 times in a 6 month period (so I could re-read it fresh each time) in order to make sure it was good enough to go to the page! Also, big thanks to &quot;themanofum&quot; (I don't know if there's a way to tag users?) for all the support and help he gave me to bring this SCP to it's end-game.</p>

