<p>I'm going to disagree with you here. Crosstesting <em>for the sake of crosstesting</em>, especially crosstests that don't make any sense, are definitely highly discouraged. But crosstests that make sense (and I do think that one w/ <a href="/scp-187">SCP-187</a> would make sense) are definitely allowable.</p>
